  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Rural and Urban Children, Communities &amp; Local Governments</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project facilitates access to appropriate information for children, youth, women and rural workers, enabling their participation in governance from local to state levels and beyond. It aims to provide access to the national employment guarantee scheme and timely support to create and/or access protection pathways, including mental health services. Additionally, the project seeks to contribute to the improvement of alcohol regulation in the State of Karnataka, reducing alcohol-related harm. The project specifically includes people with permanent or temporary mental impairments.</narrative>
  </description>
